{"nodes":[{"id":"r3root01","type":"text","text":"# 内容向／人物行为向｜R3十元理论融合总览\n\n现实知识层 → 关系生成层 → 十元动态层 → 五维主题层 → 场景／单话／序列输出\n\n十元不是关键词标签，而是对象在关系中产生作用的方式。","x":-420,"y":-1280,"width":840,"height":420,"color":"4"},{"id":"auditR3","type":"file","file":"09-给674（我）用的库/漫画理论/韩国漫画大学课程库/92_审计/2026-07-23_R3十轮排版与理论融合审计.md","x":-360,"y":-760,"width":720,"height":330,"color":"4"},{"id":"knowgrp1","type":"group","label":"① 现实知识层｜课程提供可验证材料","x":-3100,"y":-250,"width":1800,"height":2450,"color":"3"},{"id":"knowtext","type":"text","text":"## 现实知识层\n\n课程知识不直接等于十元。\n它先提供：事实对象｜制度规则｜空间流程｜职业行为｜表现方法｜训练证据","x":-2910,"y":-80,"width":1420,"height":330,"color":"3"},{"id":"worldR3","type":"file","file":"09-给674（我）用的库/漫画理论/韩国漫画大学课程库/04_知识模块/世界观与资料调查.md","x":-2890,"y":360,"width":620,"height":300},{"id":"objectR3","type":"file","file":"09-给674（我）用的库/漫画理论/韩国漫画大学课程库/04_知识模块/对象库深层结构.md","x":-2180,"y":360,"width":620,"height":300},{"id":"psyR301","type":"file","file":"09-给674（我）用的库/漫画理论/韩国漫画大学课程库/04_知识模块/角色心理与行为库.md","x":-2890,"y":750,"width":620,"height":300},{"id":"behR301","type":"file","file":"09-给674（我）用的库/漫画理论/韩国漫画大学课程库/04_知识模块/人物行为库深层结构.md","x":-2180,"y":750,"width":620,"height":300},{"id":"storyR3","type":"file","file":"09-给674（我）用的库/漫画理论/韩国漫画大学课程库/04_知识模块/故事写作知识体系.md","x":-2890,"y":1140,"width":620,"height":300},{"id":"perform3","type":"file","file":"09-给674（我）用的库/漫画理论/韩国漫画大学课程库/04_知识模块/漫画分镜与Webtoon演出.md","x":-2180,"y":1140,"width":620,"height":300},{"id":"courseR3","type":"text","text":"### 课程知识三种作用\n\n1. 事实材料\n2. 表现方法\n3. 验证机制\n\n禁止把课程名直接配给十元节点。","x":-2890,"y":1560,"width":1330,"height":410,"color":"3"},{"id":"relgrp01","type":"group","label":"② 关系生成层｜对象为什么诱发这些行为","x":-950,"y":-250,"width":1900,"height":2450,"color":"6"},{"id":"relgen01","type":"text","text":"## 关系生成器\n\n对象属性＋状态＋控制权＋稀缺度＋可见性＋关系绑定\n→ 人物判断价值／威胁\n→ 产生欲望与恐惧\n→ 限制可选行为","x":-760,"y":-80,"width":1520,"height":430,"color":"6"},{"id":"behaviorloop","type":"text","text":"### 人物行为闭环\n\n触发器\n→ 第一行为\n→ 对方依据自身目标回应\n→ 升级／修正／撤回\n→ 收益与代价\n→ 对象、信息、关系状态变化","x":-760,"y":470,"width":720,"height":570,"color":"6"},{"id":"responseR","type":"file","file":"09-给674（我）用的库/漫画理论/韩国漫画大学课程库/04_知识模块/回应代价与关系状态机.md","x":80,"y":470,"width":680,"height":340,"color":"1"},{"id":"relationvar","type":"text","text":"### 关系七变量\n\n信任｜权力差｜情感距离｜依赖度｜债务｜信息差｜关系定义权\n\n场景结束至少改变一项，不能自动复原。","x":80,"y":900,"width":680,"height":400,"color":"1"},{"id":"judgegate","type":"text","text":"### 进入十元判断前必须成立\n\n✓ 对象状态明确\n✓ 行为可观察\n✓ 对方有独立回应\n✓ 代价改变下一场条件\n✓ 关系变量发生变化","x":-760,"y":1320,"width":1520,"height":430,"color":"2"},{"id":"tengrpR3","type":"group","label":"③ 十元动态层｜作用方式而非关键词","x":1300,"y":-250,"width":2500,"height":2450,"color":"5"},{"id":"tenruleR","type":"text","text":"## 十元判断规则\n\n表面动作 → 行为目的 → 对方选择权变化 → 资源／信息／边界变化 → 十元作用\n\n同一动作可属于不同节点；必须写主节点、副节点、体量与顺序。","x":1480,"y":-80,"width":2140,"height":400,"color":"5"},{"id":"tenA01","type":"text","text":"### xn｜过程积累\n行为持续、反复、养成、推进\n检查：变化是否依靠时间积累？","x":1480,"y":420,"width":650,"height":300,"color":"5"},{"id":"tenA02","type":"text","text":"### z｜节点截断\n决定、禁止、停止、切断\n检查：是否形成明确节点或中止？","x":2220,"y":420,"width":650,"height":300,"color":"5"},{"id":"tenA03","type":"text","text":"### zn｜主体生成\n表达、确认、保护、生成\n检查：是否保存或增强主体性？","x":2960,"y":420,"width":650,"height":300,"color":"5"},{"id":"tenB01","type":"text","text":"### x｜边界定义\n定义、拒绝、维持、排除\n检查：谁划定身份、形式或边界？","x":1480,"y":800,"width":650,"height":300,"color":"5"},{"id":"tenB02","type":"text","text":"### x并z｜系统秩序\n配置、分类、管理、约束\n检查：规则如何组织空间与行动？","x":2220,"y":800,"width":650,"height":300,"color":"5"},{"id":"tenB03","type":"text","text":"### n｜关系承载\n靠近、共享、协调、依赖\n检查：谁在承载连接与位置？","x":2960,"y":800,"width":650,"height":300,"color":"5"},{"id":"tenC01","type":"text","text":"### zx｜显性执行\n追逐、攻击、控制、执行\n检查：外部行动怎样直接制造结果？","x":1480,"y":1180,"width":650,"height":300,"color":"5"},{"id":"tenC02","type":"text","text":"### nx｜代价吸收\n让步、承担、补偿、回收\n检查：谁把自身让出以吸收代价？","x":2220,"y":1180,"width":650,"height":300,"color":"5"},{"id":"tenC03","type":"text","text":"### xz｜临界逼迫\n跨线、剥夺、压迫、不可逆\n检查：选择空间是否被推到极限？","x":2960,"y":1180,"width":650,"height":300,"color":"5"},{"id":"tenD01","type":"text","text":"### nz｜停靠回归\n等待、陪伴、保存、修复、返回\n检查：什么关系或空间允许停靠？","x":1850,"y":1560,"width":780,"height":300,"color":"5"},{"id":"relationR3","type":"text","text":"### 生克补＋体量＋顺序\n\n生：扩大对方作用\n克：压缩对方作用空间\n补：补足缺失条件\n\n节点A(体量) → 节点B(体量) → 节点C(体量)","x":2730,"y":1560,"width":880,"height":420,"color":"5"},{"id":"fivegrp1","type":"group","label":"④ 五维主题层｜动态链最终检验的问题","x":-3100,"y":2450,"width":6900,"height":1100,"color":"4"},{"id":"fiveT01","type":"text","text":"时间｜xn＋z\n过程怎样积累、截断与回收","x":-2890,"y":2660,"width":1100,"height":300,"color":"4"},{"id":"fiveT02","type":"text","text":"本体｜zn＋x\n主体怎样生成、被定义、保护或抹除","x":-1610,"y":2660,"width":1100,"height":300,"color":"4"},{"id":"fiveT03","type":"text","text":"空间｜x并z＋n\n位置、规则、承载与通路怎样组织行动","x":-330,"y":2660,"width":1100,"height":300,"color":"4"},{"id":"fiveT04","type":"text","text":"因果｜zx＋nx\n显性执行与代价承担怎样形成结果","x":950,"y":2660,"width":1100,"height":300,"color":"4"},{"id":"fiveT05","type":"text","text":"命运｜xz＋nz\n不可逆压力与归属回归怎样改变选择","x":2230,"y":2660,"width":1100,"height":300,"color":"4"},{"id":"outputgrp","type":"group","label":"⑤ 创作输出与验证","x":-3100,"y":3780,"width":6900,"height":1450,"color":"2"},{"id":"chainR3","type":"file","file":"09-给674（我）用的库/漫画理论/韩国漫画大学课程库/04_知识模块/内容行为动态链与训练.md","x":-2860,"y":4020,"width":760,"height":330,"color":"2"},{"id":"matrixR3","type":"file","file":"09-给674（我）用的库/漫画理论/韩国漫画大学课程库/06_矩阵/课程知识作业矩阵.md","x":-1910,"y":4020,"width":760,"height":330,"color":"2"},{"id":"indexR3","type":"file","file":"09-给674（我）用的库/漫画理论/韩国漫画大学课程库/01_课程总纲/十元化_内容人物行为索引.md","x":-960,"y":4020,"width":760,"height":330,"color":"2"},{"id":"sceneout","type":"text","text":"### 场景输出\n对象＋触发＋行为＋回应＋代价＋关系变化＋十元动态链","x":-10,"y":4020,"width":760,"height":330,"color":"2"},{"id":"episodeout","type":"text","text":"### 单话／序列输出\n局部闭环＋升级＋选择＋不可逆变化＋话尾后果","x":940,"y":4020,"width":760,"height":330,"color":"2"},{"id":"caseout1","type":"text","text":"### 案例反证区\n韩漫逐场景验证｜同一行为跨节点比较｜误判表｜95分门槛","x":1890,"y":4020,"width":760,"height":330,"color":"2"},{"id":"finalflow","type":"text","text":"## R3最终工作流\n\n课程材料 → 对象状态 → 关系约束 → 行为闭环 → 十元作用 → 生克补／体量／顺序 → 五维主题 → 场景与连载 → 案例反证回流","x":-960,"y":4520,"width":1920,"height":450,"color":"4"}],"edges":[{"id":"r3e001","fromNode":"r3root01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"auditR3","toSide":"top","label":"10轮审计"},{"id":"r3e002","fromNode":"auditR3","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"knowtext","toSide":"top","label":"先读现实知识"},{"id":"r3e003","fromNode":"objectR3","fromSide":"right","toNode":"relgen01","toSide":"left","label":"对象进入关系"},{"id":"r3e004","fromNode":"behR301","fromSide":"right","toNode":"behaviorloop","toSide":"left","label":"行为进入闭环"},{"id":"r3e005","fromNode":"behaviorloop","fromSide":"right","toNode":"responseR","toSide":"left","label":"产生独立回应"},{"id":"r3e006","fromNode":"judgegate","fromSide":"right","toNode":"tenruleR","toSide":"left","label":"满足后判断十元"},{"id":"r3e007","fromNode":"relationR3","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"fiveT04","toSide":"top","label":"动态链进入主题"},{"id":"r3e008","fromNode":"fiveT01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"chainR3","toSide":"top","label":"转成输出"},{"id":"r3e009","fromNode":"fiveT02","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"matrixR3","toSide":"top","label":"训练验证"},{"id":"r3e010","fromNode":"fiveT03","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"indexR3","toSide":"top","label":"统一索引"},{"id":"r3e011","fromNode":"fiveT04","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"sceneout","toSide":"top","label":"场景"},{"id":"r3e012","fromNode":"fiveT05","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"episodeout","toSide":"top","label":"连载"},{"id":"r3e013","fromNode":"episodeout","fromSide":"right","toNode":"caseout1","toSide":"left","label":"案例反证"},{"id":"r3e014","fromNode":"sceneout","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"finalflow","toSide":"top","label":"回收"},{"id":"r3e015","fromNode":"caseout1","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"finalflow","toSide":"right","label":"审计回流"}]}